<Slide style={{
  width: '1280px', height: '720px',
  background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #8B1A1A 0%, #5C0E0E 50%, #8B1A1A 100%)',
  padding: '60px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center',
  position: 'relative', overflow: 'hidden',
}}>
  {/* 装饰元素 */}
  <svg width={600} height={600} viewBox="0 0 600 600" style={{ position: 'absolute', right: 0, top: 0, opacity: 0.06 }}>
    <circle cx="300" cy="300" r="280" fill="none" stroke="#fff" strokeWidth="2" />
    <circle cx="300" cy="300" r="200" fill="none" stroke="#fff" strokeWidth="2" />
    <circle cx="300" cy="300" r="120" fill="none" stroke="#fff" strokeWidth="2" />
  </svg>
  {/* 章节序号 */}
  <Box style={{ marginBottom: 16 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#C9A227', letterSpacing: 6 }}>CHAPTER 01</Text>
  </Box>
  {/* 大字 */}
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 80, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FDF6EC', marginBottom: 16 }}>
    机会数
  </Text>
  {/* 副标题 */}
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#F3D9B5', marginBottom: 24 }}>
    快速听牌的量化武器
  </Text>
  {/* 引言 */}
  <Box style={{ maxWidth: 680, textAlign: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E8C98A', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
      "机会数理论的核心内容就是如何快速听牌"<br />
      <span style={{ fontSize: 14, opacity: 0.7 }}>——《成都册》第一章 · 44 人划线</span>
    </Text>
  </Box>
  {/* 页脚 */}
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 30, right: 60 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E8C98A', opacity: 0.5 }}>03 / 16</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
